# The Pokémon Tower (FireRed's MUS_POKE_TOWER, which its seven floors share): a hushed, slow lament in E minor, an
# organ line over a choir's held chords, a low bell tolling each bar and a deep bass. A place indoors plays the same by
# day and night. Original composition for this game (plan 19 · K5).
